// PROBE -- throwaway, delete once the gate question is settled.
//
// Prints back everything the submit handler is handed, because three separate
// unknowns are answered by one tap:
//   - does `form.get("values")` carry the radio selection?
//   - does `form.get("name")` carry the form name? The real feature plans to
//     ride the request id in there, so if it is absent the binding scheme
//     needs a different carrier entirely.
//   - what does a CANCEL deliver? trigger_on_cancel is true, so cancelling
//     invokes this too, and the docs never show how the two differ.
//
// Create in the bot builder as a FORM function named exactly:
//     claudeCliqProbeSubmit

response = Map();
try
{
	response.put("text", "values = " + form.get("values") + "\nname = " + form.get("name") + "\nkeys = " + form.keys() + "\nwhole = " + form);
}
catch (e)
{
	response.put("text", "submit handler error: " + e.toString());
}
return response;
